{"title":"2007 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/3/87365022dc742eb56240b5506a51fca232a3e25e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{10} + \\frac{3}{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"87\" height=\"38\" /> is equal to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/f/69ff37d7d2e9d13e6ec1dcdb66b747266272bbbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0.33 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 0.303 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 625 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 400 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"443\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/3/4a36dbe3d72a6ba8afe9a2ea8d8c76b7643feeaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{10} = 0.300$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/d/91d243e36227c84c6a81ce3ca8cd2b3d70d6056d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{1000} = 0.003$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"108\" height=\"38\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/6/6e6f9af28022ddcc1e7a6d9072636be3733ef703.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{10} + \\frac{3}{1000} = 0.300 + 0.003$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"216\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><span style=\"color:red\">$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 0.303}}$ (Error compiling LaTeX. Unknown error_msg)</span>\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/4/234fcf9a37781322b8f27fde61cbd8a2ca419b55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{10} = \\frac{3 \\times 100}{10 \\times 100} = \\frac{300}{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"184\" height=\"40\" /> from the greatest common denominator. We then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/7/ca7bcedc9f04a29275e0c858f2f315857245f432.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{10} + \\frac{3}{1000} = \\frac{300}{1000} + \\frac{3}{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"214\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/7/cf75d0f087565a846b13a745192fc1aa4befffc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{300 + 3}{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"84\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/2/9a282566a49e8fbe549da34aaa0b61c03f8764a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{303}{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"61\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><span style=\"color:red\">$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 0.303}}$ (Error compiling LaTeX. Unknown error_msg)</span>\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/qwqoP9Nvtjs?si=JNCKUt-kg8kvClll&amp;t=28\">https://youtu.be/qwqoP9Nvtjs?si=JNCKUt-kg8kvClll&amp;t=28</a> (also has problem 1 and 3-10)\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<